  "title": "Turkey Delight",
  "description": "Turkey Delight is a delicious way to use everyone&#39;s favorite Thanksgiving leftovers in a single dish. Turkey, gravy, potatoes and stuffing form a magnificent holiday quartet. I often prepare the dish on Thanksgiving Day, then cook it a few days later.",
